{"seq":1,"slug":"mitochondria-respiration","title":"线粒体与细胞呼吸","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/energy-metabolism/mitochondria-respiration","wordCount":1723,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"线粒体与细胞呼吸\">线粒体与细胞呼吸</h1><p>你此刻读这句话所用的脑力，归根结底来自一种叫 ATP 的小分子在你脑细胞线粒体里被反复合成与水解。一个成年人静息一天周转的 ATP 总质量与自身体重相当——不是储存这么多，而是同一批分子被回收利用上千次。本篇讲清这台「能量心脏」如何把食物中的化学能逐级榨取并转成细胞通用的能量货币，是全 hub 详述有氧呼吸与 ATP 合成的唯一一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>细胞呼吸是把葡萄糖等有机物逐步氧化、将释放的能量捕获为 ATP 的过程。有氧呼吸分四个阶段：糖酵解（胞质）、丙酮酸氧化与三羧酸循环（线粒体基质）、以及电子传递链与氧化磷酸化（线粒体内膜）。总反应可写作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_6H_{12}O_6 + 6\\,O_2 \\rightarrow 6\\,CO_2 + 6\\,H_2O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>，伴随大量 ATP 生成。</p>\n<p>线粒体的双层膜结构是这一切的舞台：外膜通透性高，内膜高度内折成嵴、富含呼吸链蛋白，膜间隙与基质被严格分隔。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[葡萄糖] --&gt; B[糖酵解&lt;br/&gt;胞质]&#10;  B --&gt; C[丙酮酸]&#10;  C --&gt; D[丙酮酸氧化&lt;br/&gt;乙酰CoA]&#10;  D --&gt; E[三羧酸循环&lt;br/&gt;基质]&#10;  E --&gt; F[NADH FADH2&lt;br/&gt;电子载体]&#10;  F --&gt; G[电子传递链&lt;br/&gt;内膜泵质子]&#10;  G --&gt; H[质子梯度]&#10;  H --&gt; I[ATP合酶&lt;br/&gt;化学渗透]&#10;  I --&gt; J[ATP]\">graph TD\n  A[葡萄糖] --&gt; B[糖酵解&lt;br/&gt;胞质]\n  B --&gt; C[丙酮酸]\n  C --&gt; D[丙酮酸氧化&lt;br/&gt;乙酰CoA]\n  D --&gt; E[三羧酸循环&lt;br/&gt;基质]\n  E --&gt; F[NADH FADH2&lt;br/&gt;电子载体]\n  F --&gt; G[电子传递链&lt;br/&gt;内膜泵质子]\n  G --&gt; H[质子梯度]\n  H --&gt; I[ATP合酶&lt;br/&gt;化学渗透]\n  I --&gt; J[ATP]</pre><p>各阶段的产物与定位对照如下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>发生位置</th>\n<th>净 ATP（底物水平/总）</th>\n<th>关键产物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>糖酵解</td>\n<td>胞质</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2 丙酮酸、2 NADH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丙酮酸氧化</td>\n<td>基质</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>2 乙酰CoA、2 NADH、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三羧酸循环</td>\n<td>基质</td>\n<td>2（GTP）</td>\n<td>6 NADH、2 FADH₂、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氧化磷酸化</td>\n<td>内膜</td>\n<td>约 26–28</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>、大量 ATP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"糖酵解-古老而普适的开场\">糖酵解：古老而普适的开场</h2><p>糖酵解在细胞质中进行，不需要氧，几乎所有生物都拥有它——这暗示它是地球早期厌氧环境的遗产。一分子葡萄糖经十步酶促反应裂解为两分子丙酮酸，净产 2 个 ATP（通过底物水平磷酸化）与 2 个 NADH。前期要「投资」2 个 ATP 活化葡萄糖，后期「回收」4 个，故净得 2 个。</p>\n<p>关键调控点是磷酸果糖激酶（PFK-1），它受 ATP 抑制、受 AMP 激活——当能量充足时减速，能量匮乏时加速。这种「按需供能」的反馈逻辑是整个代谢调控的缩影，更系统的讨论见 <a href=\"cell-metabolism-homeostasis\">细胞代谢与稳态</a>。在缺氧时，丙酮酸经发酵转为乳酸（动物）或乙醇（酵母），以再生 NAD⁺ 维持糖酵解运转——这是剧烈运动时肌肉酸痛的部分来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三羧酸循环-碳骨架的彻底拆解\">三羧酸循环：碳骨架的彻底拆解</h2><p>进入线粒体的丙酮酸先被氧化脱羧、与辅酶 A 结合成乙酰辅酶 A，再进入三羧酸循环（又称柠檬酸循环或克雷布斯循环）。乙酰基的两个碳逐圈被氧化成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每转一圈产出 3 个 NADH、1 个 FADH₂、1 个 GTP。循环本身产生的 ATP 很少，其真正价值在于把碳骨架中的高能电子打包进 NADH 与 FADH₂ 这两种电子载体，送往下一阶段兑现。</p>\n<p>三羧酸循环还是代谢的「中央枢纽」：它的中间产物可分流去合成氨基酸、血红素等，糖、脂、蛋白三大类物质的分解产物也都汇入此处。这种「条条大路通柠檬酸循环」的格局，使它成为联系分解代谢与合成代谢的十字路口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"化学渗透-彼得-米切尔的洞见\">化学渗透：彼得·米切尔的洞见</h2><p>电子传递链与 ATP 合成如何耦合，曾是生化界一大谜题。1961 年彼得·米切尔提出化学渗透假说：电子沿内膜上的复合体 I–IV 逐级传递、最终交给氧生成水，这一放能过程被用来把质子从基质泵到膜间隙，形成跨内膜的电化学质子梯度（即质子动力势）。质子顺梯度回流时驱动 ATP 合酶旋转，催化 ADP 与磷酸合成 ATP。</p>\n<p>这一假说当年颇受质疑，因为它主张能量以「梯度」而非某种高能中间化合物的形式临时储存——这与人们对膜运输中「梯度即货币」的理解一脉相承（见 <a href=\"../cell-fundamentals/membranes-and-transport\">生物膜与膜运输</a>）。米切尔因此独得 1978 年诺贝尔化学奖。</p>\n<p>质子动力势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 由化学势（pH 差）与电势（膜电位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span>）两部分构成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ψ</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.303</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>F</mi></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta p = \\Delta\\psi - \\frac{2.303\\,RT}{F}\\,\\Delta\\mathrm{pH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2.303</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pH</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 为气体常数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为温度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 为法拉第常数。这一表达式定量刻画了储存在膜两侧的能量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"atp-合酶-分子尺度的旋转马达\">ATP 合酶：分子尺度的旋转马达</h2><p>ATP 合酶是一台真正会转的分子机器，由膜内的 F₀ 部分与伸入基质的 F₁ 部分组成。质子穿过 F₀ 通道时驱动其转子旋转，旋转的机械力传递到 F₁ 的催化头部，迫使其三个催化位点循环改变构象、依次完成 ATP 的结合、合成与释放。这一「结合变化机制」由保罗·博耶提出、约翰·沃克用晶体结构证实，二人共获 1997 年诺贝尔化学奖。</p>\n<p>值得注意的是，每氧化一个 NADH 实际产出的 ATP 并非整数（约 2.5 个），FADH₂ 约 1.5 个，因为质子梯度还被挪用于运输等其他用途，且存在「质子泄漏」。这也是教科书上「一分子葡萄糖产 30–32 个 ATP」而非旧版「36–38」的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线粒体的多重身份\">线粒体的多重身份</h2><p>线粒体远不止是「发电厂」。它参与钙稳态缓冲、合成血红素与铁硫簇、调节细胞内氧化还原状态，并在程序性死亡中扮演开关角色——细胞色素 c 从线粒体释放是凋亡内源通路的启动信号，详见 <a href=\"../fate-frontiers/apoptosis-and-autophagy\">细胞凋亡与自噬</a>。线粒体拥有自己的环状 DNA（源于内共生，见 <a href=\"../cell-fundamentals/cell-theory-and-types\">细胞学说与细胞类型</a>），母系遗传，其突变与一类线粒体疾病相关。</p>\n<p>线粒体的数量与活性随细胞能量需求动态调节，受 AMPK 等能量感应通路调控——这把我们引向更宏观的代谢整合视角，即下一篇 <a href=\"cell-metabolism-homeostasis\">细胞代谢与稳态</a>。植物细胞中与之能量流向相反的产能细胞器，则是 <a href=\"chloroplast-photosynthesis\">叶绿体与光合作用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>有氧呼吸分四阶段：糖酵解（胞质）、丙酮酸氧化与三羧酸循环（基质）、电子传递链与氧化磷酸化（内膜）。</li>\n<li>糖酵解古老普适、净产 2 ATP，PFK-1 受 ATP/AMP 反馈调控；缺氧时靠发酵再生 NAD⁺。</li>\n<li>三羧酸循环把碳彻底氧化成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，主要价值是产出 NADH/FADH₂，并作为代谢中央枢纽。</li>\n<li>米切尔化学渗透假说：电子传递泵质子建立质子动力势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，ATP 合酶借质子回流旋转合成 ATP。</li>\n<li>一分子葡萄糖实际净产约 30–32 ATP；线粒体还参与钙稳态、氧化还原与凋亡，与稳态及命运两篇相连。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线粒体与细胞呼吸","id":"线粒体与细胞呼吸"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"糖酵解：古老而普适的开场","id":"糖酵解-古老而普适的开场"},{"level":2,"text":"三羧酸循环：碳骨架的彻底拆解","id":"三羧酸循环-碳骨架的彻底拆解"},{"level":2,"text":"化学渗透：彼得·米切尔的洞见","id":"化学渗透-彼得-米切尔的洞见"},{"level":2,"text":"ATP 合酶：分子尺度的旋转马达","id":"atp-合酶-分子尺度的旋转马达"},{"level":2,"text":"线粒体的多重身份","id":"线粒体的多重身份"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"细胞器与内膜系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/cell-fundamentals/organelles-endomembrane-system"},"next":{"title":"叶绿体与光合作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/energy-metabolism/chloroplast-photosynthesis"}}